dlss-nr-player
==============

This repository contains only the Linux host/glue code (MIT). It does not
contain NVIDIA binaries, model weights, DLSSNR-AMD binaries, VapourSynth
binaries, mpv, VLC, or FFmpeg.

Third-party components referenced or partially included:

- DLSSNR-AMD (MIT)
  https://github.com/mochizuki0323/DLSSNR-AMD
  The Vulkan compute implementation of the DLSS 5 NR network. Users must obtain
  the source separately; this repository does not vendor it.

- VapourSynth R81 API 4 headers (LGPL-2.1)
  https://github.com/vapoursynth/vapoursynth
  third_party/vapoursynth/include/*.h, third_party/vapoursynth/COPYING.LESSER
  These headers are used only to compile the plugin.

- AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 1 (MIT)
  Included in DLSSNR-AMD's runtime shaders; not redistributed here.

- NVIDIA DLSS / nvngx_dlssnr.dll and the DLSS 5 NR model weights
  Proprietary. Not included. Users must supply their own legally obtained copy;
  do not redistribute.

- mpv, FFmpeg, VLC, VapourSynth runtime
  Separate projects with their own licenses; not bundled.

dlss-nr-player is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by NVIDIA or AMD.
